  "html": "<p>您有發現，台科大校園外觀最近不一樣了嗎? 🏫</p>\n<p>EMRD在學校新設了醒目的廣告牌，增加EMRD學程能見度與知名度🥰</p>\n<p>經過校門口的圍牆與基隆路高架道路時，可以多看我們一眼喔😎</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"/legacy/img/7b6c91c0be-451304.jpg\" width=\"300\">&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"267\" src=\"/legacy/img/852cb40eb8-451299.jpg\" width=\"200\"></p>\n<p>-------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>📣110年EMRD碩士在職專班招生📣</p>\n<p>🎯網路報名截止日期：12月04日-12月18日 17:00止</p>\n<p>📋備審資料上傳截止日期：12月21日17:00止</p>\n<p>🎯報名系統：<a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ntust.edu.tw%2F110entry2%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR0BFr_811pWBeX5rYR-0xZE6FuGVKizp16CXgnUZ782CyD7qExnQdyZRZ4&amp;h=AT1f_QjOIIrl3XYDCExd3oaulsdVOfvcrHmeqpUAd7FDerEw5jB0kM6VG1xSsf8xRIZOWE098r5rdKMDSwZhvkZcvTPIZ31QwscUcsu-NX6_8H1kTMysk6I8Y1VmJnfU&amp;__tn__=-UK-R&amp;c[0]=AT1iqiGgLJjwfBhVH11YB_SV5rmzFKbn0jaEh3dIgsdNd7rC8t-OaCMCzkGpldxx2eM4NxDOlsIP1DHvPIWfBGm-2Rn1DCOv8f2r7rmn7R3uworewYFaPb94Eyl8mvEmMIai0YZt3pmvsomG5OEQYSFZDg\">http://www.ntust.edu.tw/110entry2/</a></p>\n<p>🎯招生簡章：<a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F362DvTf%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR1op9rZQ08D62kVuRjMlGZdDRa-VDngpw50HFtIwU7jpdEYH_qUx2lOOOo&amp;h=AT30jG3fBpaXNEzDP4k8gdFD6AF1whdbLA2aNNhD8TwcIgrGgpSOieBMc4R-3TvcaSSk-AKMSVm8CcLx3zYv010x5Ff2qcWuuO1FRedRAwurlZbqa0_jy4hshOvxRgEA&amp;__tn__=-UK-R&amp;c[0]=AT1iqiGgLJjwfBhVH11YB_SV5rmzFKbn0jaEh3dIgsdNd7rC8t-OaCMCzkGpldxx2eM4NxDOlsIP1DHvPIWfBGm-2Rn1DCOv8f2r7rmn7R3uworewYFaPb94Eyl8mvEmMIai0YZt3pmvsomG5OEQYSFZDg\">https://bit.ly/362DvTf</a></p>\n<p>🎯常見Q&amp;A大補帖：<a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F2HY0PsM%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR0PpnnZUudMjIXLq05J1-SqTdO9HZx0hd7aos32e2NRr1S0rMpzo3BxHjc&amp;h=AT1RnkBjH5FJ1gLFfV4B16HBceuDcjBzFqYt9qAhmGqLxU9xM2mzNjN0c1c9rBmQYf0ze_UJ2-uSwzxKrGHVhTXZY8zqJve5kIKS-MkR08kpKHm4HN_BWJcBZY4E1VQe&amp;__tn__=-UK-R&amp;c[0]=AT1iqiGgLJjwfBhVH11YB_SV5rmzFKbn0jaEh3dIgsdNd7rC8t-OaCMCzkGpldxx2eM4NxDOlsIP1DHvPIWfBGm-2Rn1DCOv8f2r7rmn7R3uworewYFaPb94Eyl8mvEmMIai0YZt3pmvsomG5OEQYSFZDg\">https://bit.ly/2HY0PsM<